at wherever your CI workspace collects reports; it defaults to a local
report/ dir for running the suite by hand.

REGRESSION TESTING (across model/prompt changes): compare any two runs
with `elyaeval compare --baseline ... --candidate ... --group-by
span_name,metric_name` (span_name matters here since the same metric name
